  - name: FACILITYHEADSURVEY_DICT.Q21_DATA_SUBMIT
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>21. Does your facility currently submit health and financial data to the DOH Information System and/or the PhilHealth Dashboard?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Kasalukuyan bang nagsusumite ang inyong pasilidad ng rutinang datos sa kalusugan at pinansyal sa DOH Information System at/o sa PhilHealth Dashboard?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHIN ANG PAGPIPILIAN NANG MALAKAS. PUMILI NG ISANG SAGOT LAMANG</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>An saindong pasilidad ba ngunyan ngsusumitir nin regular na health asin financial na datos sa DOH Information System asin Philhealth Dashboard?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Naga sumite ba ug health and financial data sa DOH Information System and/or Philealth Dashboard ang inyong pasilidad?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Naga sumite ba ang inyong pasilidad ug datos sa kahimsog ug pinansyal sa DOH Information System ug/o PhilHealth Dashboard?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>An iyo ba pasilidad in nagpapasa yana hin datos parti panlawas ngan panalapi ha DOH Information System ngan/o ha PhilHealth Dashboard?</p><p class="instruction">BASAHA HA MAKUSOG AN MGA OPSYON. PILI MA USA LA NA BATON</p>
          HIL: |
            <p>Ang inyo pasilidad nagapasa bala sang health kag financial data sa DOH Information System kag/ukon sa PhilHealth Dashboard?</p><p class="instruction">READ OPTIONS OUT LOUD. SELECT ONE ANSWER ONLY.</p>
          ILO: |
            <p>(Agdama kadi nga agisubmitir ti pasilidadyo iti datos ti salun-at ken pinansial iti DOH Information System ken/wenno iti</p><p class="instruction">(BASAEN TI OPTIONS ITI NAIPAAY. PILIEN TI MAYSA LAENG A SUNGBAT.)</p>
