  - name: FACILITYHEADSURVEY_DICT.Q67_INTEND_ACCRED
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>67. Are you intending to become a YAKAP/Konsulta provider?</p>
          FIL: |
            <p>Nagbabalak ba kayong maging YAKAP/Konsulta provider?</p>
          BCL: |
            <p>May plano ba kamo na maging YAKAP/Konsulta provider?</p>
          BIS: |
            <p>Nagplano ba ka nga mahimong YAKAP/Konsulta provider?</p>
          CEB: |
            <p>Nagtinguha ba kamo nga mahimong YAKAP/Konsulta provider?</p>
          WAR: |
            <p>Mayda ka ba tuyo nga magin YAKAP/Konsulta probider?</p>
